---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About">
  <article class="about-page">
    <span class="kicker">About me</span>
    <h1>Helping you find your way into AI.</h1>
    <div class="article-body">
      <p>I’m Lisandro de Cuba, an AI practitioner focused mainly on Microsoft technologies.</p>
      <p>I created decuba.tech to help beginners and intermediate users understand AI without getting lost in technical language, product announcements or complicated documentation.</p>
      <p>Most of my work involves Microsoft Copilot, Copilot Studio, Microsoft Foundry, Azure AI and the wider Microsoft cloud platform. I use these tools in practice, test how they behave and turn what I learn into clear guides you can follow.</p>
      <p>You’ll find practical explanations, step-by-step tutorials and honest notes about building with AI. I explain where to start, which choices you need to make and what can go wrong. When a topic requires technical knowledge, I introduce it gradually and include concrete examples.</p>
      <p>Sharing knowledge has always been an important part of my work. After more than 25 years in Microsoft technology, I know how difficult a new platform can feel at first. My goal is to help you build confidence, understand the fundamentals and progress toward creating your own AI solutions.</p>
      <p>You do not need to be an AI expert to start. Curiosity and a willingness to experiment are enough.</p>
      <p><small>decuba.tech is my personal technology blog. The views, experiences and lessons shared here are my own.</small></p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
.about-page{max-width:920px}.about-page h1{max-width:12ch;margin:1rem 0 2.5rem;font-size:clamp(3rem,7vw,6.2rem);line-height:.96;letter-spacing:-.07em}.about-page .article-body{max-width:760px}.about-page .article-body p:first-child{color:var(--ink);font-size:1.3rem;font-weight:650;line-height:1.65}.about-page small{display:block;margin-top:2.5rem;padding-top:1.2rem;border-top:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--muted);font-size:.78rem;line-height:1.6}
</style>
